<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Lab 06 - DOM XSS in jQuery selector sink', currentLab: 'lab06' }) %>

<div class="lab-banner">
  <div class="lab-meta">
    <span class="lab-pill">Lab 06</span>
    <span>DOM-based XSS (hashchange)</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="lab-title">DOM XSS in jQuery selector sink using a hashchange event</h1>
  <p class="lab-description">
    Lab ini berisi kerentanan DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting pada halaman blog. Skrip memanfaatkan pustaka jQuery 1.8.x
    untuk mendeteksi event <code>hashchange</code> dan mencari judul artikel menggunakan selector <code>:contains(...)</code>
    dari nilai <code>location.hash</code> tanpa sanitasi.
  </p>
  <div style="margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); font-size: 0.85rem; color: #93c5fd;">
    💡 <em>Petunjuk eksploitasi:</em> Gunakan <a href="<%= helperUrl %>" target="_blank" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;">Challenge Helper Page</a> (origin terpisah) untuk membuat dokumen HTML pemicu yang menyematkan iframe ke lab ini.
  </div>
</div>

<section class="blog-list" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
  <% posts.forEach(post => { %>
    <article class="card" style="margin-bottom: 0;" id="post-<%= post.id %>">
      <header class="post-header" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <h2 class="post-title" style="font-size: 1.45rem;"><%= post.title %></h2>
        <div class="post-meta">
          By <strong><%= post.author %></strong> &bull; <%= post.created_at %>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="post-content" style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        <p><%= post.content %></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  <% }); %>
</section>

<!-- Local jQuery 1.8.x library -->
<script src="/js/vendor/jquery-1.8.3.min.js"></script>
<script>
  // VULNERABLE SINK: jQuery $() selector parsing with location.hash on hashchange
  $(window).on('hashchange', function() {
    var query = decodeURIComponent(window.location.hash.slice(1));
    if (query) {
      var post = $('section.blog-list h2:contains(' + query + ')');
      if (post && post.length > 0) {
        post.get(0).scrollIntoView();
      }
    }
  });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
